    "detailed_description": "Embark on a spot the difference adventure like never before with Vispo \u2013 where the classic game meets the excitement of videos!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTravel through real and imaginary worlds, exploring beautiful scenes in movies and videos. With over 160 levels and 20,000 unique frames, the fun never ends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZoom in with your gamepad or mouse, spot the differences, and tap them. No time limits, just pure enjoyment. Need help? Picture hints are there for the trickier puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWorried about progress? Scores are saved to the cloud, allowing seamless play across multiple devices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRevolutionize your spot the difference experience \u2013 Vispo is not just a game; it's a whole new level of fun! Start spotting now and see the difference for yourself.",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on a spot the difference adventure like never before with Vispo \u2013 where the classic game meets the excitement of videos!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTravel through real and imaginary worlds, exploring beautiful scenes in movies and videos. With over 160 levels and 20,000 unique frames, the fun never ends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZoom in with your gamepad or mouse, spot the differences, and tap them. No time limits, just pure enjoyment. Need help? Picture hints are there for the trickier puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWorried about progress? Scores are saved to the cloud, allowing seamless play across multiple devices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRevolutionize your spot the difference experience \u2013 Vispo is not just a game; it's a whole new level of fun! Start spotting now and see the difference for yourself.",
